1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:03,020
What if your portfolio could protect itself?

2
00:00:04,700 --> 00:00:06,300
Meet Finance Fairies.

3
00:00:06,700 --> 00:00:08,433
Two rules, in plain words.

4
00:00:08,433 --> 00:00:12,300
You set the boundaries. Your fairy handles the complexity.

5
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:14,050
Your rules become lines,

6
00:00:14,050 --> 00:00:16,770
and a daily budget for your worst likely day.

7
00:00:17,100 --> 00:00:19,670
Every close, it checks four alarms,

8
00:00:19,670 --> 00:00:22,680
and asks why: the market, or your stocks?

9
00:00:22,900 --> 00:00:25,897
Then it rotates, five percent at a time,

10
00:00:25,897 --> 00:00:28,070
into calmer assets. Not cash.

11
00:00:28,300 --> 00:00:31,648
Gemini proposes a plan through tools. It cannot trade.

12
00:00:31,648 --> 00:00:34,810
The plan must pass eight checks. The maths decides.

13
00:00:35,100 --> 00:00:36,840
In the app, you watch it act.

14
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:39,679
On October the thirtieth, chips sold off.

15
00:00:39,679 --> 00:00:41,692
Gemini found the news behind it,

16
00:00:41,692 --> 00:00:44,460
checked its own plan twice, and asked first.

17
00:00:44,700 --> 00:00:47,536
Early 2025: holding lost 10.3 percent.

18
00:00:47,536 --> 00:00:50,148
Guardian stayed inside both limits.

19
00:00:50,148 --> 00:00:53,880
It won't beat a bull market. It keeps your limits.

20
00:00:54,200 --> 00:00:56,417
Finance Fairies. You set the rules.

21
00:00:56,417 --> 00:00:59,710
Gemini does the thinking. The maths keeps it honest.

